      "rationale": "This simplification states an additional fact relating externally defined integer equality and ordering to cubeSearch; it does not define a fresh symbol on its left-hand side and was not proved separately before use.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-050c02c309a5a530a8227be9add80d806c43948fb2a4cee44e6a4d8da7a1a71d",
      "start_line": 30,
      "text": "  rule ((I *Int I) *Int I ==Int A) => cubeSearch(A, I)\n    requires notBool ((I *Int I) *Int I <Int A)\n    [simplification]"
    },
    {
